<title>CROATIA: Croatian Feb trade gap doubles to $346 mln mo/mo.</title>
<headline>Croatian Feb trade gap doubles to $346 mln mo/mo.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>CROATIA MERCHANDISE TRADE</p>
<p>					   FEBRUARY    JANUARY    FEB '96</p>
<p> balance (million dollars)	  -346	  -168	 -210</p>
<p> exports				   373	   484	  292</p>
<p> imports				   719	   652	  502</p>
<p>NOTE -- Cumulative January-February figures show a 25.8 percent rise in exports and a 33.3 percent rise in imports in comparison with the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
